      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.uUA6Z4NSiP6D0FC3]{Domain Convocation}</p><p>You channel a 20-foot aura around yourself and your convocator. While channeling, you take a 10-foot status penalty to your speeds, but if you Cast a Spell that targets your convocator (including if it targets a familiar, an animal companion, or eidolon), you increase the range by 30 feet.</p>"
